      {
        "text": "What does a Friday feel like? A cold brew with a caramel kiss and a salty finish.\n\nThat’s exactly what our new Salted Caramel Cold Brew delivers. We’ve taken our classic 18‑hour steep and turned it into a playful, balanced flavor that’s both sweet and savory.\n\nMade with beans from Araku and Coorg, the brew carries the same farm‑to‑cup story you love, now with a caramel swirl and a pinch of sea salt.\n\nAvailable in 300 ml bottles for Rs 170, it’s ready for your desk, your study session, or a quick gift for a friend who loves trying new coffee twists.\n\nCurious? Come by the cafe on Friday, or order online and we’ll ship it to your doorstep.\n\nHow will you enjoy your first sip?  \n#GreenLeafCoffee #SmallBatchCoffee #ColdBrew",
